          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it worth the price?",
            "answer": "<p>Llama Naturals costs more because it's made differently. Most kids' vitamins start as candy. Ours start with whole organic fruits, without synthetic shortcuts, added cane sugar, or artificial ingredients. ent here.</p>"
